# Line endings are the repository's business, not each machine's core.autocrlf setting.
#
# Everything is stored and checked out with LF, as .editorconfig asks. `eol=lf` overrides a global
# core.autocrlf=true, which would otherwise hand Mac and Linux users a CRLF `fix-subs` launcher
# ("bad interpreter"). The Windows launcher is the exception: cmd.exe wants CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
